+// Port diagnostics: for a sample of game draws, count the pixels Piglet lets through and log the
+// state that decides it. If none pass, the draw is repeated with depth test, scissor and culling
+// off to see which of them is discarding everything.
+// Set from ps4.ini (diagnostics=on) by DolphinNoGUI; the probes below stall the GPU.
